  "description": "EF Core audit/change-tracking library. Intercepts SaveChanges, captures every Insert/Update/Delete via ChangeTracker, and writes audit rows to a header/detail table pair inside the same transaction as the user's save. Configurable schema, pluggable value and entity-key serializers, opt-out via [NotAudited].",
